{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Lane f041, 2026-10-19: call-site inventory on origin/main c0cf1022671, refreshed before plan review (the description's earlier cites were on 2e81cb9767c1).\n\nCI-run CLI invocations of the 9 old spellings (an AST scan: a verb literal as the first or second positional argument of a CLI helper call, or as the first element after `rebar`/`rebar.cli` in an argv list). These retarget to `store <sub>`:\n- scripts/probe_rebar.py:496,498,589,590,591\n- tests/integration/test_b636_rebuild_history_loss.py:110,123 (integration tier)\n- tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py: 29 `_engine_run`/`_engine_run_env` calls at :957-1889 (integration tier)\n- tests/integration/test_epoch_guard_reconciliation.py:236 (integration tier)\n- tests/interfaces/contracts/test_event_schema_forward_compat.py:135,246\n- tests/interfaces/contracts/test_schema_coverage.py:101,102,114\n- tests/interfaces/contracts/test_schema_outputs.py:250\n- tests/interfaces/contracts/test_store_compat_gate.py:219,232,240,254,456\n- tests/interfaces/facades/test_fsck_structured_326f.py:59\n- tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_compact_process_death.py:105,164\n- tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py:73\n- tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_signature.py:150,166,170\n- tests/interfaces/store/test_commits_on_ticket.py:145\n- tests/interfaces/store/test_fsck_push_pending.py:77,95,129\n- tests/interfaces/store/test_updated_at.py:36\n- tests/interfaces/store/test_workflow_run_state.py:181\n- tests/interfaces/test_tracker_footprint_cli.py:92,133,150,178,199\n- tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py:433 (`_cli._dispatch(\"doctor\", ...)`)\n- tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_store.py:198\n- tests/unit/test_authorship_batched_ticket_map_7084.py:78\n- tests/unit/test_identity_3183_heldout.py:196\n- tests/unit/test_cli_registry.py:108-116 (`route_for(\"tracker-footprint\")`), plus `_CENSUS_SETS` and `_INDIVIDUAL_ARMS`\n- tests/unit/test_cli_registry_dispatch.py:180-184 (init census), :236-270 (init spies via `_execute.execute`)\n- tests/unit/test_core_cli_parsers.py:54-58,77-80 (census), :342-345 (governance rows)\n\nNot CLI invocations, left alone: `bridge fsck` calls (test_bridge_vocabulary_e2e_heldout.py:85, test_bridge_vocabulary_heldout.py:150, test_schema_outputs.py:252); MCP `call_tool(\"fsck\")` (test_mcp.py, test_fsck_structured_326f.py:70); the `surface` parametrize ids in test_repair_pause_ownership_heldout.py, which call helpers directly; git subcommands named `fsck`; `rebar.compact` library calls.\n\nNon-test CI invocations: `.github/workflows/compact-sweep.yml:153` (`rebar compact-all`), the only workflow/infra/Makefile caller. Comments at compact-sweep.yml:90 and reconcile-bridge.yml:107 name `rebar fsck`. Nothing under `infra/`, the `Makefile`, or `src/rebar/_engine` shells out to these spellings.\n\nIn-source strings (step 9): 84 lines naming `rebar <old spelling>` in 42 files under src/rebar (lines per spelling, overlapping where a line names two: fsck 22, fsck-recover 12, doctor 16, compact 7, compact-all 4, tracker-maintenance 6, tracker-footprint 4, export 7, import 8 after excluding `from rebar import`), including 5 schema descriptions (doctor, export, fsck, ticket_state, tracker_footprint).\n\nTeaching surfaces (step 10): about 55 hits in current docs (user-guide 9, concurrency 12, chatgpt-agent-guide 7, scale-envelope 4, migrations 4, output-schemas 3, import-export 3, plus single hits in about 12 more), plus README.md:343, AGENTS.md:264, src/rebar/_guides/writing-a-passing-plan.md:282, and examples/mcp-clients/{claude/.mcp.json:12, codex/config.toml:13, copilot/mcp-config.json:12}. Frozen history (docs/archive, docs/experiments, docs/adr, docs/release-notes.md, CHANGELOG.md, reports/) is left as written.\n\nStory 1 precedent: its LLM-Review blocked twice on teaching surfaces that the plan had deferred to the docs